{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39039","headline":"上蜀王 · 张道古","name":"上蜀王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"封章才达冕旒前，黜诏俄离玉座端。\n二乱岂由明主用，五危终被佞臣弹。\n西巡凤府非爲固，东播銮舆卒未安。\n谏疏至今如可在，谁能更与读来看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张道古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}